# Two header rows with a colspan category cell

Header row 1: "Region" plus the category cell "Sales" spanning the two
sub-columns "North"/"South" of header row 2. The merge lies entirely inside
the header block, which is legal.

+--------+-------+-------+
| Region |   Sales       |
+--------+-------+-------+
|        | North | South |
+========+=======+=======+
| East   | 10    | 20    |
+--------+-------+-------+
